  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "ZA로열에서 봤다.\n네가 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0006>지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041B85CC5F4C5D0C11C0020BD24B2E4002E000AB124AC00002000100002010000000010000219000006C9C0003F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 포켓몬 트레이너로서\nZA로열의 열렬한 팬이라서 말이다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020D3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108B85CC11C000A005A0041B85CC5F4C7580020C5F4B82CD55C0020D32CC774B77CC11C0020B9D0C774B2E4002E001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "새로운 전술이 떠오를 때마다\nZA로열 트레이너에게 시험해 보고 있단다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C8B85CC6B40020C804C220C7740020B5A0C624B97C0020B54CB9C8B2E4000A005A0041B85CC5F40020D2B8B808C774B108C5D0AC8C0020C2DCD5D8D5740020BCF4ACE00020C788B2E8B2E4002E001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고 참 신기하단 말이지.\n너 같은 아이가 그런 활약을 하다니.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE00020CC380020C2E0AE30D558B2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002E000AB1080020AC19C7400020C544C774AC000020ADF8B7F00020D65CC57DC7440020D558B2E4B2C8002E001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA로열의 수준이\n떨어졌다는 방증인가?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041B85CC5F4C7580020C218C900C774000AB5A8C5B4C84CB2E4B2940020BC29C99DC778AC00003F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 그건 포켓몬 승부로 확인해 보면 되겠지!\n그럼! 나의 전술을 맛보게 해 주마!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020ADF8AC740020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B85C0020D655C778D5740020BCF4BA740020B418ACA0C9C00021000AADF8B7FC00210020B098C7580020C804C220C7440020B9DBBCF4AC8C0020D5740020C8FCB9C80021001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나와 싸울 준비가 되거든\n언제든지 말하거라!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C6400020C2F8C6B80020C900BE44AC000020B418AC70B4E0000AC5B8C81CB4E0C9C00020B9D0D558AC70B77C0021001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 나의 전술을 맛볼 준비는 됐나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020B098C7580020C804C220C7440020B9DBBCFC0020C900BE44B2940020B410B098003F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직이요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C1C774C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA로열 트레이너는\n승부를 좋아하는 게 아니었던가?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어째서 상대해 주지 않는 거지!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041B85CC5F40020D2B8B808C774B108B294000AC2B9BD80B97C0020C88BC544D558B2940020AC8C0020C544B2C8C5C8B358AC00003F00100001BE00000AC5B4C9F8C11C0020C0C1B300D5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AB2940020AC70C9C00021003F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "배틀에 있어서 공격이란\n데미지를 주는 게 전부가 아니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC30D2C0C5D00020C788C5B4C11C0020ACF5ACA9C774B780000AB370BBF8C9C0B97C0020C8FCB2940020AC8C0020C804BD80AC000020C544B2C8B2E40021001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬에게 나무열매를 지니게 하면\n어떻게 되는지 승부를 통해 보여 주마!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8C0020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020C9C0B2C8AC8C0020D558BA74000AC5B4B5BBAC8C0020B418B294C9C00020C2B9BD80B97C0020D1B5D5740020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCB9C80021001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나의 ‘나무열매 지니게 하기 전술’을\n돌파하다니 믿을 수 없군...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n포켓몬에게 도구를 지니게 하면\n상황에 따라 효과를 발휘한단다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앞으로 잘 지내보자는 뜻에서\n이 오랭열매를 주마!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C55EC73CB85C0020C7980020C9C0B0B4BCF4C790B2940020B73BC5D0C11C000AC7740020C624B7ADC5F4B9E4B97C0020C8FCB9C80021001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오랭열매를 지닌 포켓몬은\n배틀 중 HP가 절반 이하가 되면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n열매를 먹고 회복할 수 있지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B7ADC5F4B9E4B97C0020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC740000ABC30D2C00020C911002000480050AC000020C808BC180020C774D558AC000020B418BA7400100001BE00000AC5F4B9E4B97C0020BA39ACE00020D68CBCF5D5600020C2180020C788C9C0002E001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앞으로 전술을 시험해 보고 싶어지면\n네게 이야기할 테니 잘 부탁한다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C55EC73CB85C0020C804C220C7440020C2DCD5D8D5740020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5B4C9C0BA74000AB124AC8C0020C774C57CAE30D5600020D14CB2C80020C7980020BD80D0C1D55CB2E40021001000020114018D0000",
